  "details": "Description\n\nI have my subsctibtion through steam, I forgot to add funds to my steam account and VRC got stuck in a loop where it was \"processing\" the payment with steam, I than contacted steam support and they resolved the issues and made the payment but before steam fixed the issue my friend gifted me VRC+, than the trasnation went through and... both substriptions are now expiering at the same date, so I paid for nothing, could this please be fixed?  \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nnot add funds to steam and than have someone gift them VRC+ before steam processes payment I guess, idk how to word it better \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
